msgid "Kernel-invoked user I/O admission"
msgstr "内核调用的用户 I/O 准入"

msgid ""
"The optional broker separates untrusted scalar input from trusted kernel "
"policy and retained user-memory ownership. The implemented operation is a "
"bounded typed GPIO read or set/reset write. There is no user-provided port, "
"MMIO address, callback, principal, private slot pointer or asynchronous DMA "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"可选 broker 将不可信标量输入与可信内核策略、保留的用户内存所有权分离。已实现操作是有界类型化 GPIO 读取或 set/reset "
"写入。用户不能提供端口、MMIO 地址、回调、主体身份、私有槽指针或异步 DMA 操作。"

msgid ""
"The 32-byte input and 8-byte output contain explicit `uint32_t` fields. The "
"trusted gateway calls the public API from privileged Thread mode with "
"incoming interrupt masks clear. A kernel identity callback authenticates the"
" current principal; the public message cannot choose it. Construction "
"retains immutable nonoverlapping nominal user RAM windows, exact device/mask"
" grants, a positive loan capacity and the kernel memory port. All known "
"broker, policy, port-table and private context spans stay outside those user"
" windows."
msgstr ""
"32 字节输入与 8 字节输出包含显式 `uint32_t` 字段。可信 gateway 在特权 Thread、进入时中断掩码全清的上下文调用公共 "
"API。内核身份回调认证当前主体，公共消息不能选择它。构造保留不可变且互不重叠的名义用户 RAM "
"窗口、精确器件／位掩码授权、正数借用容量和内核内存端口。全部已知 broker、策略、端口表与私有 context 范围位于用户窗口之外。"

msgid ""
"Admission validates full-span arithmetic, alignment, access and one-window "
"containment before pinning. `pin` must establish the specified CPU access "
"and retain address-space/process/mapping lifetime until successful `unpin`. "
"A failed pin must leave no mapping references or residual effects. The "
"whitelist alone does not establish actual mapped RAM, DMA reachability, MMIO"
" exclusion or MPU isolation; the trusted kernel and SoC memory layout "
"establish those facts."
msgstr ""
"准入在 pin 前校验完整跨度运算、对齐、访问权限与单窗口包含关系。`pin` 必须建立指定 CPU 访问能力，并保留地址空间／进程／映射生命周期，直到"
" `unpin` 成功。pin 失败不能残留映射引用或效果。白名单自身不能证明实际映射 RAM、DMA 可达性、MMIO 排除或 MPU "
"隔离；可信内核与 SoC 内存布局负责建立这些事实。"

msgid ""
"The input is pinned and copied once into kernel storage. Policy checks use "
"that snapshot. The reply span is pinned before any GPIO operation. A final "
"saved-mask guard serializes revocation with the bounded scalar provider "
"operation. Close before this guard prohibits the effect; close after "
"dispatch cannot undo it. Every dispatched result copies a fully initialized "
"reply, including provider errors. A cancelled admission leaves the reply "
"untouched. Pins remain held through all copies."
msgstr ""
"输入被 pin 后只复制一次到内核存储，策略使用该快照。任何 GPIO 操作前先 pin 回复范围。最终保存掩码的 guard "
"将撤销与有界标量提供者操作串行化；进入 guard 前 close 禁止效果，dispatch 后 close 不能撤销效果。每个 dispatch "
"结果都复制完全初始化的回复，包括提供者错误；取消准入不修改回复。全部复制期间持续保留 pin。"

msgid ""
"`result` reports admission/device execution and `cleanup_result` reports the"
" most recent release attempt. `accepted` becomes true at the first "
"successful pin. `device_effect_possible` is set before calling the WRITE "
"provider, even if that provider returns an error. `retained` requires the "
"exact kernel call slot, user memory and address-space identity to stay "
"alive. Cleanup tries output then input release, records errors and preserves"
" every failed pin independently. `gpio_finish` retries only retained "
"cleanup; it never rereads users, writes a reply or repeats a device "
"operation. Neither an operation error nor successful cleanup authorizes "
"replay of an earlier write."
msgstr ""
"`result` 报告准入／器件执行，`cleanup_result` 报告最近释放尝试。首次 pin 成功时 `accepted` 变为 "
"true。WRITE 提供者调用前设置 `device_effect_possible`，即使提供者随后返回错误。`retained` "
"要求精确内核调用槽、用户内存及地址空间身份保持存活。清理先尝试输出再尝试输入释放，记录错误并独立保留每个失败 pin。`gpio_finish` "
"仅重试保留清理，绝不重新读取用户、写回复或重复器件操作。操作错误或清理成功都不能授权重放先前写入。"

msgid ""
"The private generic loan mechanism retains one exact slot pointer with a "
"monotonic 64-bit epoch. Copied tokens and stale epochs cannot release it; "
"epoch exhaustion rejects reuse. Read-only spans may share bytes; any "
"writable overlap with a peer loan rejects. Known policy, provider, other "
"loan and drain-control aliases reject before mutation. Only the two exact "
"internal GPIO child slots may share their own call proof. A trusted drain "
"callback must prove actual peripheral/DMA/IRQ/deferred/copy final access and"
" observer join. User input cannot claim this proof. A failed proof or unpin "
"keeps the exact pin and token retained."
msgstr ""
"私有通用借用机制保留精确槽指针与单调 64 位 epoch。复制 token 与旧 epoch 不能释放它；epoch "
"耗尽拒绝复用。只读范围可共享字节，任何可写范围与对等借用重叠均拒绝。已知策略、提供者、其他借用和排空控制别名均在修改前拒绝。只有两个精确内部 GPIO "
"子槽可以共享自身调用证明。可信排空回调须证明实际外设／DMA／IRQ／延后执行／复制的最终访问及观察者 join；用户输入不能声明此证明。证明或 "
"unpin 失败保留精确 pin 与 token。"

msgid ""
"One privileged serialized kernel owner controls a broker and its slots. All "
"memory/proof callbacks are bounded and run outside Arch guards; they may "
"mark close, but cannot recursively admit, release, execute or retain the "
"cookie output. Close inhibits admission and preserves every live loan. "
"Quiescence is valid only after close, with zero loans/list entries and no "
"executor. It does not implicitly stop providers or establish an application "
"shutdown barrier. There is no reopen or hidden identity registry. "
"NMI/fault/SMP publishers and unserialized privileged memory writers are "
"outside this contract."
msgstr ""
"唯一特权串行内核所有者控制 broker 及其槽。全部内存／证明回调有界且在 Arch guard 外执行，可以标记 "
"close，但不能递归准入、释放、执行或保留 cookie 输出。Close 禁止准入且保留全部活动借用。只有 close "
"后、借用／列表条目为零且无执行者，静止证明才有效。它不隐式停止提供者，也不建立应用停机屏障。没有 reopen "
"或隐藏身份注册表。NMI／fault／SMP 发布者和非串行特权内存写入者不在本合同内。"

msgid ""
"This is a component callable by an integrating privileged kernel, not an "
"implemented userspace transport. FreeRTOS SVC/MPU wrappers, task principal "
"authentication, real memory pins, fault-safe copy mechanisms and TrustZone "
"veneers are not connected in this slice. Generic loans provide ownership "
"mechanics; asynchronous UART/SPI/CAN user messages are not implemented. "
"Those future transports must supply their actual provider drain and memory-"
"port contracts rather than accepting a user-supplied “drained” flag."
msgstr ""
"这是可由集成特权内核调用的组件，不是已实现的用户空间 transport。本切片未接入 FreeRTOS SVC／MPU 包装、任务主体认证、真实内存 "
"pin、fault-safe 复制或 TrustZone veneer。通用借用提供所有权机制；异步 UART／SPI／CAN 用户消息尚未实现。未来 "
"transport 必须提供实际提供者排空与内存端口合同，不能接受用户提交的“已排空”标志。"

msgid ""
"Google tests run the actual broker, typed GPIO wrapper, Native GPIO "
"provider, Core request state and Native saved-mask implementation. They "
"model only the external kernel identity/pin/unpin/proof boundary and "
"privileged context. Behavioral RED/GREEN logs, sanitizer runs, public-header"
" probes and strict ARM compilation are recorded in "
"`tools/testing/evidence/user-io-broker-iteration/manifest.json`. These "
"establish software behavior and compilation, not physical isolation, HIL "
"timing or a qualified product release. The optional archive defines no "
"mutable globals; default factory/source/ELF omission is verified separately "
"by the integrating build graph."
msgstr ""
"Google 测试执行真实 broker、类型化 GPIO 包装、Native GPIO 提供者、Core 请求状态与 Native "
"保存掩码实现，只模拟外部内核身份／pin／unpin／证明边界及特权上下文。行为 RED/GREEN 日志、sanitizer、公共头文件探针与严格 "
"ARM 编译记录在 `tools/testing/evidence/user-io-broker-"
"iteration/manifest.json`。这些证明软件行为和编译，不证明物理隔离、HIL 时序或产品发布资格。可选 archive "
"无可变全局变量；默认 factory／源码／ELF 的省略由集成构建图另行验证。"
